#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:1
msgid "llvm-config - Print LLVM compilation options"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:6
msgid "SYNOPSIS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:8
msgid "**llvm-config** *option* \\[*components*...\\]"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:10
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:12
msgid ""
"**llvm-config** makes it easier to build applications that use LLVM. It can "
"print the compiler flags, linker flags and object libraries needed to link "
"against LLVM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:16
msgid "EXAMPLES"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:18
msgid "To link against the JIT:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:26
msgid "OPTIONS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:29
msgid "Print the assertion mode used when LLVM was built (ON or OFF)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:33
msgid "Print the installation directory for LLVM binaries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:37
msgid "Print the build mode used when LLVM was built (e.g. Debug or Release)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:41
msgid "Print the build system used to build LLVM (e.g. `cmake` or `gn`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:45
msgid "Print the C compiler flags needed to use LLVM headers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:49
msgid "Print the installation directory for LLVM CMake modules."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:53
msgid "Print all valid component names."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:57
msgid "Print the C preprocessor flags needed to use LLVM headers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:61
msgid "Print the C++ compiler flags needed to use LLVM headers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:65
msgid "Print whether or not LLVM was built with rtti (YES or NO)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:69
msgid "Print a summary of **llvm-config** arguments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:73
msgid "Print the target triple used to configure LLVM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:77
msgid "Ignore libLLVM and link component libraries instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:81
msgid "Print the installation directory for LLVM headers."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:85
msgid "Print the flags needed to link against LLVM libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:89
msgid "Print the installation directory for LLVM libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:93
msgid ""
"Similar to **--libs**, but print the full path to each library file. This is "
"useful when creating makefile dependencies, to ensure that a tool is "
"relinked if any library it uses changes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:99
msgid ""
"Similar to **--libs**, but prints the bare filenames of the libraries "
"without **-l** or pathnames. Useful for linking against a not-yet-installed "
"copy of LLVM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:105
msgid ""
"Print all the libraries needed to link against the specified LLVM "
"*components*, including any dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:110
msgid "Link the components as shared libraries."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:114
msgid "Link the component libraries statically."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:118
msgid "Print the object root used to build LLVM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:122
msgid "Print the installation prefix for LLVM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:126
msgid ""
"Quote and escape paths when needed, most notably when a quote, space, "
"backslash or dollar sign characters are present in the path."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:131
msgid ""
"Print how the provided components can be collectively linked (`shared` or "
"`static`)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:135
msgid ""
"Print all the system libraries needed to link against the specified LLVM "
"*components*, including any dependencies."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:140
msgid ""
"Print the component names for all targets supported by this copy of LLVM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:144
msgid "Print the version number of LLVM."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:147
msgid "COMPONENTS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:149
msgid ""
"To print a list of all available components, run **llvm-config --"
"components**. In most cases, components correspond directly to LLVM "
"libraries. Useful \"virtual\" components include:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:153
msgid "**all**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:154
msgid ""
"Includes all LLVM libraries. The default if no components are specified."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:156
msgid "**backend**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:157
msgid "Includes either a native backend or the C backend."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:159
msgid "**engine**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:160
msgid "Includes either a native JIT or the bitcode interpreter."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:162
msgid "EXIT STATUS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../CommandGuide/llvm-config.md:164
msgid ""
"If **llvm-config** succeeds, it will exit with 0. Otherwise, if an error "
"occurs, it will exit with a non-zero value."
msgstr ""
